/ locals: current_server, blocked
.small.text-muted.mb-2 Been given a reward code?

- if blocked
  .text-muted.small
    i.bi.bi-inbox.me-1
    | Finish what's waiting for you first.
- elsif !current_server.connected?
  .text-muted.small
    i.bi.bi-plug.me-1
    | #{current_server.server_id} is offline. Rewards are handed over in game, so this has to wait until it is back.
- else
  = form_with url: server_reward_path(current_server.public_id), method: :post
    = hidden_field_tag :idempotency_key, SecureRandom.uuid
    .input-group.input-group-sm
      = text_field_tag :reward_id, nil, class: "form-control", placeholder: "Reward code", autocomplete: "off", required: true, aria: {label: "Reward code"}
      = submit_tag "Redeem", name: nil, class: "btn btn-outline-success"
